! The Research Ledger Holds Many Witnesses

A pet-named location carries a changing relational community: CAD bodies, terrain,
photographs, drawings, point fields, void networks, histories, and unsolved forms.
Each witness keeps the constraints its own measurements can support. A painting
supplies visible pixels; a DEM supplies terrain heights in a declared frame;
a photogrammetric reconstruction supplies poses and surfaces conditionally on
its calibration; a CAD body supplies checked construction. None silently grants
the authority of another.

The research archive lives at `tools/projection-loom/docs/research/register.md`
and retains the historical experiments, literature and present-day boundaries.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/catmas>>

!! Pattern-Integrity Rhymes

* ''Cybernetics / requisite variety:'' keep multiple viable structural hypotheses where evidence underdetermines a site. A single winning guess cannot speak for all unseen geometry.
* ''Inverse graphics / factor graphs:'' separate source measurements, registration parameters, construction variables, and interpretive priors; never let a camera move to conceal bad geometry.
* ''Shape grammars / program synthesis:'' grow discrete operations and continuous parameters; discover reusable macros only after repeated witnessed relationships support them.
* ''Survey / GIS:'' preserve affine pixel positions, native CRS, horizontal units, nodata, vertical datum and independently tested transformations.
* ''IFC / open voids:'' relate openings, recesses and rooms by purpose; an opening and a traversable route answer different tests.
* ''OpenUSD / compositional scenes:'' let distinct bodies and variants share a location without forcing a scene-wide Boolean union.
* ''Typed graph rewriting:'' do not orphan children, overwrite source testimony or silently rebind twins when a branch changes.
* ''Quality diversity / ecological slack:'' retain viable alternatives in structurally different niches, including valid unnamed surprises.
* ''Multi-fidelity optimization:'' use cheap proxies to order attention; use exact CAD/void audits to admit a construction.
* ''W3C provenance / causal islands:'' preserve what source, method and code produced each claim without fabricating a global now.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/witness-ladder>>

!! Source Ladder and Gauge

One image -> provisional pixels and visible contours. Multiple registered photos -> constrained multi-view surfaces. Survey control -> anchored measurements. GeoTIFF DEM -> measured cells and native metadata. Mesh/point cloud -> witnessed sampled surfaces. CAD/IFC -> authored structural relationships. A mixed collection -> intersecting testimony and explicit conflicts.

The unobserved stays unobserved. An image without metric control never confers meters. A provisional image camera never graduates because a generated silhouette looks persuasive. An uncertain relationship may retain alternatives until another witness arrives.

<<~/ahu>>

